Triage measured 2026-10-10 at c0c2fab. The library was built through the real build with -fanalyzer, where -Werror makes each analyzer warning an error, for CORE and for POSIX live (DETERMINISTIC=0), with gcc-13 and gcc-15. 4 distinct findings, all false positives:
(1) lab_dispatch.c:574 'group[] uninitialized' (both versions): the group holds every entry at the lane's top priority, so it is never empty when lane->n > 0;
